{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_mode": "sha256-utf8",
  "resource": "MC2Game/Localization/Coalesced.int",
  "input_sha256": "179e265cfc9e6d3e9f2586abe75b5da303b2af9b8484079851dab72f9f7edb8c",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:a478db007ca41dcbacc70e63e1fc64dfd1e669b7285bd2242789416273941ab7",
      "source_sha256": "758898a23ad6ea4f5912e4de4587b2586731ff721322ae2bc844f1fc628bfb42",
      "translation": "请听我说说。最近有几件麻烦事……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4dd4188a98a43c80fb7551163550cfcaf0da1e004de796caa43a7b15b6d1f3ad",
      "source_sha256": "98535f81d68aa9410462cfc42f1a1f309d236b191ffe0c068da1af5110eab67f",
      "translation": "其中最让人头疼的，就是东南边的杜南盗贼。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:dca3be1814dc216ba2be5001b17b62a829b719836f9f7ba02dd6f3a0ecbf89fe",
      "source_sha256": "f16d888a8a2633771b4f2d56a4b3e4fc927b9ad049b4283673a806baa82b2e90",
      "translation": "这些家伙隔三差五就会来，偷走各种粮食和生活用品。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5795e33ff1e98cbc285f48e20efb0023088e07da42947f833916ef5d840bfb9a",
      "source_sha256": "445b1271a7b45b4ac44af5f8907cb45140d7d734447d2c9061b327cfac8bbdb0",
      "translation": "幸好他们好像还算有点良心，不伤人，也不拿金银财物。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:00e600276079924dc0af1fe1b58a999f20690f886b6e9293883bcda595c862ee",
      "source_sha256": "29c2efaa27dc216ab3ab696b8e799be867d9ba246ad62955357cf9a2c1251806",
      "translation": "可谁知道他们什么时候会突然变得凶恶起来？真是让人头疼啊。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:19e4bb275efd4265f1c59ac7c32b1123b612e17bb184e4da345d724bdb816c27",
      "source_sha256": "97423ff7c1e726535bde4e5be9326aae676c289827f336ba5ca9671dfedd1ea0",
      "translation": "我想趁现在好好教训他们一顿……您愿意帮忙吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6874acd7b7cd9b5e975a922fa02df7b3c3b44654f2b1bc5850206a1fc6d4d2bf",
      "source_sha256": "e143a448a26555e6ffede83507185427bf6a9caeed3626c578baee8c99c227bc",
      "translation": "差不多又到他们来的时候了。他们一出现，就请立刻教训他们。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:eec37d93172389e462bf32c10ae87b24ae666d0ad01eb23153d4af632ce1be54",
      "source_sha256": "fa49d99765b7cdc1203d1a7d05a03f031cc48922e981c29d2ea944df0a5db3d3",
      "translation": "唉……一想到还要继续受那些家伙折腾，我就觉得眼前一片漆黑。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e7c5855902223305af857a8d9b0c0ef0d952ca1c7bceafc8864b69e7733b7d15",
      "source_sha256": "9cd602c10a16e03f735feb3face74842b77c0bd0c2fec0699bc10ab74e97b5d4",
      "translation": "嗯？你……你这家伙！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6220850f4b425cccb33007325a576d2087025ffbecb81348f4563844d75eb39b",
      "source_sha256": "eb6a40061ba763ebcedd03b36b6a36c0c20fe990ca16f84a97f791b402ee1369",
      "translation": "终于让我遇到你了，杀害我父母的仇人！你根本不知道，我盼这一天盼了多久！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7fcf1013e31bba3311db2c477f5bfa2fbc0c4323ebef1358df241dc153e0685d",
      "source_sha256": "6a4031472606a29a675824d52a82eb2182de7d93caf402fbadd638880f240b51",
      "translation": "你转眼间就把我的人生推入深渊。现在，该由我送你下地狱了！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:38119944317c8b31ff19e50007d4bc5111b5b97ca5244b94e1ea3393ab3bf220",
      "source_sha256": "0a78a985dac96eb4a31d0837db00af8294ed4596cba4c6b4fa92aa0a13b73141",
      "translation": "真是太感谢您了，帮我赶走了那些家伙。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ab29b2da796c204595eab38f43d521fd982d5747e8fabf8d8db60ce98c93e73c",
      "source_sha256": "526d3cc5d46b239ed5079bc717e8fa63b6a89e9ab502056a822f7ebde1fa2b2a",
      "translation": "不过，东南边那些盗贼的窝点还在，不知道他们以后又会闹出什么事来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e574a05fb5d1ad87009a32eefb7b28f1999449f5b6825603a8354893fa26eac1",
      "source_sha256": "b5c98a98a9294407074c10664451c1f5cb426d8df2d3b7876a68d744ae3190f8",
      "translation": "杜南平原的麻烦"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5a24f3db8077c1e69867edbb7fda1778529f1ba558323b1926396d41d05db060",
      "source_sha256": "78ea784375a2da5882e853efb2dea0a74cb0010ef0ccca76f685c0be4a5a2aba",
      "translation": "打退反复洗劫杜南平原休息站的\\n盗贼"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d9eeaafff169e424ae3031f494a66042f9c3b766755d0e807e42fbffd79c65d4",
      "source_sha256": "6d10884607c72847df11d139b99cecd67fba61ef6b3335ca66885612b3a828e5",
      "translation": "居然请来了守卫，这家的主人倒还挺会动脑筋。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:884038f45654f30c7711ecdccbd63e28e26f316000bf6d85d0a96be26630cfa1",
      "source_sha256": "fb9d9c88251586e0f11af151155f8893a21db07463b49f332d4dada1dca23f4e",
      "translation": "看你们轻轻松松就赶走了杜南盗贼，果然个个身手不凡啊。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e053489e55a6f22b18004161b4c0e6614f4ded18cd5cbdf0a0db517888f3c386",
      "source_sha256": "5ec083abd37427e1779ab20d8c2c5763e23fb7b93b6ad63553c0aa941e47add6",
      "translation": "所以，虽然有些过意不去，我还想再拜托你们一件事。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f9547fb3b4b7451811aff92f7b94da7b515baf63b554ed15808f393b7495b623",
      "source_sha256": "b279f1aaad145fbe1f2d1d18bc5d40504075521807b2ca159d013a21a77ea6b7",
      "translation": "正如刚才所说，[杜南盗贼窝点]就在东南边。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:1e43ba57d206462d8f5dfee3c57425202308bec3808cfb08d223bcb8f5d30258",
      "source_sha256": "28dfc5bf42117d2b2fdc1231d1f1ba3b5ee46b757a79972ea0b87236d075108d",
      "translation": "这次能否去教训一下窝点里的盗贼头目，让他们再也不敢来这里？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0eba13a41d7b4545274454583e0deb21ee93f9801e6c1ee46efff4b6bb1cad45",
      "source_sha256": "78e5c9b576bf93cd2b8e2f3a9174401262ecd044a85048a20125d660e89a64aa",
      "translation": "报酬方面，我一定不会亏待你们。怎么样？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c8ba4ef4c07941ccbe15738a86ae73cb3adde1b527067693db7e8f97e92fdec8",
      "source_sha256": "ce8e001dc5bcee72ea23cb21b3d0a913f10cdcc4ef196f34aecad14ea05da1a1",
      "translation": "太好了。杜南盗贼窝点就在东南边。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:91a0b46bcfeaf75f8fb09e2480a8e6a59f25a3b513016d6ccc74daf128989bc7",
      "source_sha256": "14ecafd3e561816ad172e9ebfbbc0209c9d21556724dcdcb8820b18346d78719",
      "translation": "你们还有其他可以推荐的人选吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:9685e860ed19d012568aecec609bfd8989de4aad1d4ba1b8d90f23db4401ea20",
      "source_sha256": "8db2eba248d3e34f1e0bd0bea93df881830f31cb333d70469fef84f94c253126",
      "translation": "要是就这样放任不管，我怕他们会来报复。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fad93cb5f3d4a827746ae0d7427198eaf09919b714aa6bc8015f02a7c6586e80",
      "source_sha256": "29f1ecc6bc5bca060d779fe56976fd8bc1ead9f821f846219997c9aba39485f5",
      "translation": "杜南盗贼窝点就在东南边。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:16689ae773ebd5d1e9767710cdb916243c4c7b3ed19dfe5a09ee1349a8b9dda6",
      "source_sha256": "2b39934bfb05547af12872d72b6a867a52551d8bb7c7bdedd21902d071d677ea",
      "translation": "你们已经教训过盗贼头目了吗？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7790725d7d6b9c4b20e6140429fd1e84e8439ffe710b636cb1bdec920e174e78",
      "source_sha256": "cdb2f20a57df48c5dc4914b81cce7a0cdc7600bbbd1a1c391d99362831767a4b",
      "translation": "辛苦了。这样一来，就不用再受盗贼骚扰了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7a2c4ec6a6db424afdd6587dd6bfe2cca21e3b1d1f9b0a5086f7d9c85021a204",
      "source_sha256": "ee086e4f27e569bfd4eeb7d8fae21f28703ec4cddcad73ce6065b9b5dcfc42b4",
      "translation": "杜南平原的麻烦(2)"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:edced3cf4606e9a9e4715a3c43a8495790d3528556bc5a71f6b56bfe27d3751b",
      "source_sha256": "cc5a1ac5e0514ffe7e7fccbf1d5daaf9fee79e4dd8687db6ddd5729f53aea6b6",
      "translation": "前往东南边的[杜南盗贼窝点]，\\n打倒杜南盗贼头目。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:5ce7c698215a620a35b4183dc2b704e9c1ccf2cfedd69783b6e9a2c8cf5de732",
      "source_sha256": "af746c9e1cc02cb0bee7ea1d8cd5679949fec34774d85713a9c967ef09ed0634",
      "translation": "QUEST : 消灭杜南盗贼头目"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f4aa9bfb977b3c07ab6254d169738af6a434eb109cad82aed136ead7319d1107",
      "source_sha256": "baeeb9a2557c52fe7848e110af4500beee7378d1ea457d4a984408da5c724051",
      "translation": "消灭杜南盗贼头目"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:c6c0d0009809241be405fb4fe5f12836a66be58727352609a2b01a6ad59239db",
      "source_sha256": "5eb281c1759798548be0ea97f8461b34e3a9e06d2f75b2ed47de3c946dcb8956",
      "translation": "其实，我们在向这里转移的途中，打算向南部军投降的计划暴露了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6efd863c65fa9824dfebef17f305060b962eaef8156d8917c7cced2416cfc8eb",
      "source_sha256": "b2175acd87bcb2df51d0bf3513ef10d0c9a9920f2c4677bc34e4c122f5d466fd",
      "translation": "在北部军眼里，我们就是叛徒。被追来的士兵包围时，我们还以为这下完了……",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:3e5ada6c14c0048b599a406b795e4f4ef6d8fea8f2f18987dc8ebfdbb813b819",
      "source_sha256": "afebfcbe2f4681960bc1209f8d502f0d228fbb11448b2a5ba6dd401b781289eb",
      "translation": "队长为了救我，把敌人引开，结果代我被抓，我才勉强逃了出来。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:42d8130ed56eb9f10db12e13e6ec18740c887e3816d2e6cae536acde579600d0",
      "source_sha256": "7dea16f29f1923b69f28d1522fd7c068e2cc7c61a4245fe77c949fa6c62c9d35",
      "translation": "求求你们。这样下去，队长会被处决的。请帮我救出队长！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0360f414f525e4e60d5525f0bab66d594c5e252237c48e69d6c6705b0bde6ed9",
      "source_sha256": "edccf278cb1ac2a93820cf9b03dea559f1a9671192cb458682657579564001ab",
      "translation": "谢谢你们。队长应该被关在我们遭到包围的地方附近。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:6c28615e04bae4130b8e59aeccd3d98ac195a498cb2e3ecd673629bfbaa87434",
      "source_sha256": "8346edbf5c44a748a056c76e9fdb0dcbb70cfae33aca97e14172c6e6919ee992",
      "translation": "好！走吧！我们去救队长！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:be77f9165490ebc6ce688916aaeb523c1a6b33e1352d4388a6fd0ec67b53ae19",
      "source_sha256": "1d3c3cd9dc7369a13aa2cc74e60be918e035b8d289045522349807f69a97c530",
      "translation": "我们都特意前来投降了……这就是南部军的答复吗！？",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2e0f00245269a63aa57d1736e9823b687e2d32cf462b0fe22e499520db6296a1",
      "source_sha256": "e4d8d4f190d35e02ef28d701ea3d36d37e742363cecb97172911c1eb37c035b8",
      "translation": "我们队长到底是为了什么才……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:2b2b1f3c5db989dd7ca4fde2600cc3623d75620a1163110e1b1e3f33ef875183",
      "source_sha256": "87ec00f7e20aec02f6de48ae84ca1d78222565a5eb0e5a717ffd60c9aa4b7395",
      "translation": "多谢相助。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:74d260fa2a30deb883a94297c9f79ddb7296122e9cb3e66f0ae870fd32c00cae",
      "source_sha256": "87d5d8eaafb27eff0f3bf077447e2363fb9d1470082d28946d6cce2963c55952",
      "translation": "反哨兵部队的战绩，我早有耳闻……没想到我也有受你们相助的一天……昨日的敌人，今日的战友啊，呵呵。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 2,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0326d334474af28f580d21baad04ca00c111a430817d23964d63f13eecdda55a",
      "source_sha256": "1fed06cc35d3a38927509393216880a150dd35341ddaf8a293474115b47dec83",
      "translation": "好，走吧。先把这场鲁哈尔特之战打完。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:ead41c5619f4860470b9fd3c00fc2249b77326cc6a45b5815ee1687bb4046e16",
      "source_sha256": "e5934e70e662d9aa0ea604aa288393ee7d032c5919cadad57f169e2c273d9e1a",
      "translation": "我会尽力相助。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:43e5156cd4a005ed2504155163a89b0e5e1b1642b2b28bfe42e2a8d24fa2dd17",
      "source_sha256": "ffb337936409e71a2146aa45793c92ca1c08930100c97d146381b66a8314d66c",
      "translation": "救出投降部队队长[麦德麦克]。\\n投降部队队长被关在鲁哈尔特盆地的某处。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:199f895c739ef55ed4c89671a5aa5a1e96cb2f33a7f5982885190821917af879",
      "source_sha256": "abdeb63f65bc25bb483b93c433fd0f2a597558ae51ccaa60dcefa8f8312c8635",
      "translation": "投降部队队长"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:afb221c4c6c07cc6e6957b0b440edc3abda744609cf0995ec61f2b9e9d2bf482",
      "source_sha256": "d1260633d93b808032555803d8931677a90e4beb7a093ce2de09e731d7c8398b",
      "translation": "只能到这里了。后面的事就拜托你们了。",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:fde5558cf77d7caed343c8dee406154a25307672241668e3745f028951e30786",
      "source_sha256": "16c637200d40eecc1a67d679771aa65235f49da5580b5242bd7f1c9545969345",
      "translation": "成人礼"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0edf10ea101dfeabcaab16a30d2a952bdb55178a6a8425dee36d8d9b9c23d5a2",
      "source_sha256": "9e187232f19f2412d4674a1b3909ff1272ead4914369bb43ebf3da543dd9dca5",
      "translation": "你的成人礼就要到了，先放下手头的事，\\n回柯塔马雷一趟吧。\\n\\n我已经做好一切准备，正等你回来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:28155f9c315c3df8112477fea180ebbfc6ec25d6f6d8a16d8115f8d3d8bfd4fc",
      "source_sha256": "67a431ec09db9b3c64baa233c155b8bd252bf42d9f3dd64cd548754bfde50e47",
      "translation": "看来……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:4a1f0f63324931a51817ceaf37f1057ed364903a152d1df099814c4b60e5b505",
      "source_sha256": "9895b2e4e65e442ec2b2cd0e76adeebcacf33fb2e475955392a7e69ff2591771",
      "translation": "公主殿下最近看起来很开心，看来\\n多半是因为你。\\n虽然我不太愿意承认，不过你的存在似乎\\n确实帮到了公主殿下。\\n\\n无论如何，你多次帮助公主殿下也是事实，\\n所以我还是心怀感激的……\\n但请别忘了，我绝不会容许你\\n对公主殿下太过无礼。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:400570c4a015a0c3666e271a8a60c40e1d38dcd7707d97b28d1972188985de01",
      "source_sha256": "d5f3c1032f904a6bc1c92f85e557bbab69bfbd7b639c10bda8dd86e7f621e518",
      "translation": "实在太感谢了！！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7035f5359e17f3007dc3263ace43504aa53ff09c6244c8a3a50cf0a11cca78e7",
      "source_sha256": "8950db1714ecc476999998d0518268f602f13db4318eeccdb94478f4563b5951",
      "translation": "你们好，我是伊格顿！\\n真的非常感谢你们救了我的命！\\n我还以为差一点就要栽在北部军手里了，\\n当时有多提心吊胆……简直没法用言语形容。\\n\\n唉，不过看来我的运气还真不错。\\n能够重获自由，我真是太高兴、太高兴了！\\n而且，也谢谢你们愿意接纳我。\\n今后也请多多关照！！"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e6e590585ff2f3c3a950d90ea0bc7fd2bd42f5d1cd2e7f4311bbe995ffe76de3",
      "source_sha256": "d1064b0edc6b79454dcbf4ba261ba4881634405211e1429545ecc3253c764c55",
      "translation": "关于连携奥义"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0dec17f30f5e44dd558d314bf8789830ddec42c5ad6d424850cf9b8ec2fe3f68",
      "source_sha256": "cd93ec6ebaefecdc3d49820650c2e306f5bf68016b3e2fafd92e840f3cae4fbe",
      "translation": "以防万一，我再解释一下连携奥义。\\n就像刚才说的，要施展连携奥义，\\n必须先切换到能够使用它的战斗样式。\\n朱特使用双手剑、我使用扇子时，\\n就能施展连携奥义。\\n\\n然后，各自积攒所需的KAN至少5个，等我们两人进入连锁状态，\\n画面中央就会显示方向键右的图标。\\n这时按下方向键右，就能施展连携奥义。\\n明白了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d880a11a11efd5c90876169501f20edcadd622fe2eb9a12c033d90ec363f18bc",
      "source_sha256": "f1b474e109021f0ad6d9f2f5a7e8733d0bdb1c42b7ce71a16a43bf44923ed807",
      "translation": "拉提专用毒药已完成"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:0f754b5c6b7ef76e5d5397b0ce083f79a67074bdfb4bce02c5b05b975c29c0ae",
      "source_sha256": "30e3a04ba716ba4d62d9fdd9c3759fbaa789ab376ab8bf51b6530c0851bcc88e",
      "translation": "南部军的各位。\\n\\n对拉提族有效的毒药已经研制完成了。\\n多亏你们帮忙找来了九节草，才比预想的更早完成。\\n\\n关于使用方法，还需要向你们说明一下。\\n有空就来我家取药吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:d294e86ba2d503329097544fea06d63339651908d42714c9246cadf22fd2f916",
      "source_sha256": "73aad5626fd57beb135c8d453018a3a9c05d28879475528661be9c8e84b058f4",
      "translation": "麦德麦克"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:e3975c3a9283f2a89b97a39515cb1c92918b45827281f23f0727e3abe03fded9",
      "source_sha256": "0fd47f78004e6a663a443722d2a0d0b2449859a142c2ebf01ac7883a384e709d",
      "translation": "杜南盗贼窝点"
    }
  ]
}
